<title>SPAIN: Majorca bus crash kills two Poles, two Spaniards.</title>
<headline>Majorca bus crash kills two Poles, two Spaniards.</headline>
<dateline>MAJORCA, Spain 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four people died and 16 were injured on Sunday when a coach carrying Polish tourists and an empty bus collided head-on on the island of Majorca, officials said.</p>
<p>Two of the dead were the Spanish drivers of the buses. The other two were Poles -- a man and a woman -- who had yet to be identified, the Polish embassy in Madrid said.</p>
